{"id":"gladko","lemma":"гладко","pos":"adv","rank":3005,"glosses":["smoothly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Rominf-%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%BA%D0%BE.wav/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Rominf-%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%BA%D0%BE.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Всё прошло очень гладко.","en":"It went very smoothly.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to pass","l":"пройти"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Операция прошла гладко.","en":"The operation went smoothly.","words":[{"g":"operation"},{"g":"to pass","l":"пройти"},null]},{"text":"Меня гладко выбрили.","en":"I got a smooth shave.","words":[{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Я очень надеюсь, что всё пройдёт гладко.","en":"I do hope everything will go smoothly.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to pass","l":"пройти"},null]},{"text":"Наша поездка прошла очень гладко.","en":"We had a very smooth ride.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"tour, journey, trip"},{"g":"to pass","l":"пройти"},{"g":"very"},null]}]}